    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Type foundry arm of Our Polite Society, a design practice formed 2008 by Jens Schildt and Matthias Kreutzer; members across Stockholm, Hamburg and Montreal (previously Amsterdam). Retail and custom typefaces: Favorite, Placard, Cubic, Facitype (FACIT Model project on Swedish office-machine ephemera), plus OPS Grotesko, Past Perfect, Capitalis Brutalis and others. Foundry (type house) for this entry; the parent OPS is a broader graphic/identity studio. Small distributed team (Size 2-10). Reviewed on Typographica and Fonts in Use, so credible established practice.",
      "source_url": null,
